faq:
  - q: Can I see what is in each vehicle?
    a: Yes. A vehicle can be a warehouse, so stock transferred to it is visible and its movements are recorded.
  - q: Do returns get recorded?
    a: Yes. Returns from a project are recorded as movements and added back to the warehouse.
